[
 {
  "i": 0,
  "start": 0.0,
  "end": 3.66,
  "text": "You've woken up as Ryomen Sukuna, the King of Curses."
 },
 {
  "i": 1,
  "start": 4.3,
  "end": 5.02,
  "text": "In real life."
 },
 {
  "i": 2,
  "start": 5.76,
  "end": 6.86,
  "text": "You have seven days."
 },
 {
  "i": 3,
  "start": 7.46,
  "end": 9.96,
  "text": "At the end of the seventh, nobody in range survives."
 },
 {
  "i": 4,
  "start": 10.92,
  "end": 16.74,
  "text": "In the story, Sukuna was a human sorcerer, so feared in the Heian era that nobody could stop him."
 },
 {
  "i": 5,
  "start": 17.26,
  "end": 19.14,
  "text": "In your version, you didn't eat a finger."
 },
 {
  "i": 6,
  "start": 19.68,
  "end": 22.16,
  "text": "You woke up with all of it, and a clock."
 },
 {
  "i": 7,
  "start": 23.04,
  "end": 27.3,
  "text": "At midnight on day seven, the biggest thing he can do opens on its own."
 },
 {
  "i": 8,
  "start": 27.3,
  "end": 29.94,
  "text": "It will not ask who is standing nearby."
 },
 {
  "i": 9,
  "start": 30.94,
  "end": 32.18,
  "text": "But first, it's Monday."
 },
 {
  "i": 10,
  "start": 32.84,
  "end": 35.14,
  "text": "You're hungry, and there's a loaf of bread on the counter."
 },
 {
  "i": 11,
  "start": 36.74,
  "end": 38.54,
  "text": "His technique has two parts."
 },
 {
  "i": 12,
  "start": 39.34,
  "end": 40.82,
  "text": "Dismantle cuts from a distance."
 },
 {
  "i": 13,
  "start": 41.76,
  "end": 42.88,
  "text": "Cleave cuts what it touches."
 },
 {
  "i": 14,
  "start": 43.86,
  "end": 46.86,
  "text": "How hard Dismantle hits depends on how much power you put in."
 },
 {
  "i": 15,
  "start": 47.62,
  "end": 50.82,
  "text": "You point two fingers at the bread and think: cut."
 },
 {
  "i": 16,
  "start": 50.82,
  "end": 52.24,
  "text": "Eleven slices."
 },
 {
  "i": 17,
  "start": 52.86,
  "end": 53.9,
  "text": "Thin as paper."
 },
 {
  "i": 18,
  "start": 54.82,
  "end": 58.5,
  "text": "And a clean line through the bag, the counter and the wall behind it."
 },
 {
  "i": 19,
  "start": 59.12,
  "end": 60.84,
  "text": "Mara, your roommate, walks in with her coffee."
 },
 {
  "i": 20,
  "start": 61.58,
  "end": 62.88,
  "text": "\"Did you just cut the wall?\""
 },
 {
  "i": 21,
  "start": 63.56,
  "end": 64.68,
  "text": "\"It was already like that.\""
 },
 {
  "i": 22,
  "start": 65.26,
  "end": 67.18,
  "text": "\"It was not already like that.\""
 },
 {
  "i": 23,
  "start": 67.94,
  "end": 70.88,
  "text": "In your version, there's one dial, and it's stuck on loud."
 },
 {
  "i": 24,
  "start": 71.6,
  "end": 72.6,
  "text": "You can't turn it down yet."
 },
 {
  "i": 25,
  "start": 72.6,
  "end": 75.16,
  "text": "Then you see your face in the bathroom mirror."
 },
 {
  "i": 26,
  "start": 75.86,
  "end": 78.1,
  "text": "There are dark marks on it that weren't there last night."
 },
 {
  "i": 27,
  "start": 79.1,
  "end": 81.56,
  "text": "The marks are the first sign that your body is changing."
 },
 {
  "i": 28,
  "start": 82.48,
  "end": 84.26,
  "text": "They'll come back every morning, a little deeper."
 },
 {
  "i": 29,
  "start": 84.94,
  "end": 88.08,
  "text": "And a voice, not loud at all, says: \"Good."
 },
 {
  "i": 30,
  "start": 88.8,
  "end": 89.62,
  "text": "Now the neighbour's dog.\""
 },
 {
  "i": 31,
  "start": 90.44,
  "end": 91.72,
  "text": "You say no out loud."
 },
 {
  "i": 32,
  "start": 92.38,
  "end": 93.84,
  "text": "Mara asks who you're talking to."
 },
 {
  "i": 33,
  "start": 94.46,
  "end": 98.58,
  "text": "In the story, Sukuna is described as sadistic, selfish and hedonistic."
 },
 {
  "i": 34,
  "start": 99.4,
  "end": 101.9,
  "text": "In your version, that personality doesn't take over."
 },
 {
  "i": 35,
  "start": 102.5,
  "end": 103.2,
  "text": "It suggests."
 },
 {
  "i": 36,
  "start": 103.2,
  "end": 105.56,
  "text": "Seven days of suggestions."
 },
 {
  "i": 37,
  "start": 106.26,
  "end": 107.12,
  "text": "Six days left."
 },
 {
  "i": 38,
  "start": 108.42,
  "end": 113.06,
  "text": "Cleave needs contact, and it adjusts itself to how tough the target is."
 },
 {
  "i": 39,
  "start": 113.66,
  "end": 115.5,
  "text": "It doesn't ask how strong the thing is."
 },
 {
  "i": 40,
  "start": 115.76,
  "end": 116.86,
  "text": "It just opens it."
 },
 {
  "i": 41,
  "start": 117.82,
  "end": 119.16,
  "text": "Mara's bike lock is steel."
 },
 {
  "i": 42,
  "start": 119.74,
  "end": 120.42,
  "text": "She's proud of it."
 },
 {
  "i": 43,
  "start": 121.06,
  "end": 122.58,
  "text": "You close your hand around the chain."
 },
 {
  "i": 44,
  "start": 123.28,
  "end": 124.56,
  "text": "It parts like licorice."
 },
 {
  "i": 45,
  "start": 125.66,
  "end": 127.34,
  "text": "\"That was a ninety-dollar lock.\""
 },
 {
  "i": 46,
  "start": 128.18,
  "end": 129.02,
  "text": "\"It was a bad lock.\""
 },
 {
  "i": 47,
  "start": 129.66,
  "end": 130.7,
  "text": "\"It was a good lock."
 },
 {
  "i": 48,
  "start": 131.12,
  "end": 132.28,
  "text": "You're a bad roommate.\""
 },
 {
  "i": 49,
  "start": 133.28,
  "end": 135.3,
  "text": "In your version, touch is a choice."
 },
 {
  "i": 50,
  "start": 135.3,
  "end": 137.76,
  "text": "That's the rule you've been counting on."
 },
 {
  "i": 51,
  "start": 138.24,
  "end": 142.32,
  "text": "At the crosswalk, a stranger grabs your sleeve to stop you stepping in front of a bus."
 },
 {
  "i": 52,
  "start": 142.96,
  "end": 143.58,
  "text": "A kind man."
 },
 {
  "i": 53,
  "start": 144.34,
  "end": 145.94,
  "text": "Your hand moves before you do."
 },
 {
  "i": 54,
  "start": 146.56,
  "end": 147.7,
  "text": "You pull away, fast."
 },
 {
  "i": 55,
  "start": 148.64,
  "end": 152.14,
  "text": "There's a clean line down his jacket from the elbow to the wrist."
 },
 {
  "i": 56,
  "start": 152.66,
  "end": 153.34,
  "text": "He thinks it tore."
 },
 {
  "i": 57,
  "start": 154.14,
  "end": 154.9,
  "text": "He thanks you anyway."
 },
 {
  "i": 58,
  "start": 156.08,
  "end": 160.3,
  "text": "Lesson two: kindness is the most dangerous thing that can happen to you now."
 },
 {
  "i": 59,
  "start": 161.16,
  "end": 161.96,
  "text": "Five days left."
 },
 {
  "i": 60,
  "start": 162.86,
  "end": 169.28,
  "text": "You cut your own palm with Dismantle by accident, and watch it close in under three seconds."
 },
 {
  "i": 61,
  "start": 169.94,
  "end": 172.32,
  "text": "Sukuna can use Reverse Cursed Technique to heal."
 },
 {
  "i": 62,
  "start": 173.2,
  "end": 174.74,
  "text": "Almost nobody in the story can."
 },
 {
  "i": 63,
  "start": 175.68,
  "end": 176.38,
  "text": "Mara stares."
 },
 {
  "i": 64,
  "start": 177.1,
  "end": 177.62,
  "text": "\"Does it hurt?\""
 },
 {
  "i": 65,
  "start": 178.52,
  "end": 180.12,
  "text": "\"Not anymore.\""
 },
 {
  "i": 66,
  "start": 180.12,
  "end": 183.88,
  "text": "In your version, every heal takes the sleep you would have had."
 },
 {
  "i": 67,
  "start": 184.26,
  "end": 184.92,
  "text": "It isn't free."
 },
 {
  "i": 68,
  "start": 185.12,
  "end": 185.76,
  "text": "It's borrowed."
 },
 {
  "i": 69,
  "start": 186.62,
  "end": 189.98,
  "text": "By Wednesday night you haven't slept in two days, and you aren't tired."
 },
 {
  "i": 70,
  "start": 190.46,
  "end": 193.82,
  "text": "Our guess is that a human brain can't run this long without rest."
 },
 {
  "i": 71,
  "start": 194.5,
  "end": 196.5,
  "text": "The voice gets louder when you're tired."
 },
 {
  "i": 72,
  "start": 196.92,
  "end": 198.18,
  "text": "That's a guess, not a fact."
 },
 {
  "i": 73,
  "start": 198.8,
  "end": 200.86,
  "text": "\"Your friend is afraid,\" the voice says."
 },
 {
  "i": 74,
  "start": 201.42,
  "end": 202.96,
  "text": "\"Fear is a form of respect.\""
 },
 {
  "i": 75,
  "start": 203.84,
  "end": 205.5,
  "text": "You turn the light off and leave it off."
 },
 {
  "i": 76,
  "start": 205.86,
  "end": 206.48,
  "text": "You don't need it."
 },
 {
  "i": 77,
  "start": 206.84,
  "end": 209.66,
  "text": "Across the hall, the neighbour's dog barks at your door all night."
 },
 {
  "i": 78,
  "start": 210.22,
  "end": 211.58,
  "text": "The voice hums along with it."
 },
 {
  "i": 79,
  "start": 212.12,
  "end": 218.6,
  "text": "At three a.m., you find yourself standing in front of that door, with two fingers raised and no memory of crossing the floor."
 },
 {
  "i": 80,
  "start": 219.3,
  "end": 220.06,
  "text": "You go back to bed."
 },
 {
  "i": 81,
  "start": 220.5,
  "end": 221.3,
  "text": "You do not sleep."
 },
 {
  "i": 82,
  "start": 222.0,
  "end": 226.38,
  "text": "You lie there and promise yourself: tomorrow, we write down every rule."
 },
 {
  "i": 83,
  "start": 227.6,
  "end": 228.72,
  "text": "Mara writes them on the fridge."
 },
 {
  "i": 84,
  "start": 229.48,
  "end": 231.1,
  "text": "Rule one: no touching people."
 },
 {
  "i": 85,
  "start": 231.66,
  "end": 233.28,
  "text": "Rule two: no touching animals."
 },
 {
  "i": 86,
  "start": 234.0,
  "end": 237.14,
  "text": "Rule three: if you start smiling, you say so out loud."
 },
 {
  "i": 87,
  "start": 237.82,
  "end": 238.54,
  "text": "It's a good list."
 },
 {
  "i": 88,
  "start": 239.2,
  "end": 239.9,
  "text": "It won't be enough."
 },
 {
  "i": 89,
  "start": 240.54,
  "end": 241.16,
  "text": "Four days left."
 },
 {
  "i": 90,
  "start": 242.12,
  "end": 246.32,
  "text": "Mara makes you promise: if you test the next one, she's there."
 },
 {
  "i": 91,
  "start": 247.04,
  "end": 251.16,
  "text": "The fire technique, Fuga, only works after Dismantle and Cleave."
 },
 {
  "i": 92,
  "start": 251.64,
  "end": 252.76,
  "text": "You have to say \"Open.\""
 },
 {
  "i": 93,
  "start": 253.42,
  "end": 255.12,
  "text": "So you cut a concrete post."
 },
 {
  "i": 94,
  "start": 255.64,
  "end": 256.24,
  "text": "Then you touch it."
 },
 {
  "i": 95,
  "start": 256.7,
  "end": 257.46,
  "text": "Then you say the word."
 },
 {
  "i": 96,
  "start": 258.26,
  "end": 263.1,
  "text": "An arrow of fire crosses the empty lot, a hundred meters, and takes a dumpster with it."
 },
 {
  "i": 97,
  "start": 264.06,
  "end": 265.06,
  "text": "Mara's eyebrows are fine."
 },
 {
  "i": 98,
  "start": 265.66,
  "end": 265.94,
  "text": "Mostly."
 },
 {
  "i": 99,
  "start": 266.7,
  "end": 268.8,
  "text": "She says, very quietly: \"You laughed.\""
 },
 {
  "i": 100,
  "start": 268.8,
  "end": 270.22,
  "text": "You hadn't noticed."
 },
 {
  "i": 101,
  "start": 271.02,
  "end": 273.86,
  "text": "In your version, that's the line the marks cross on Thursday."
 },
 {
  "i": 102,
  "start": 274.52,
  "end": 275.38,
  "text": "They reach your jaw."
 },
 {
  "i": 103,
  "start": 276.1,
  "end": 279.68,
  "text": "The voice says: \"Now you understand why I never needed anyone.\""
 },
 {
  "i": 104,
  "start": 280.48,
  "end": 282.98,
  "text": "In the story, Sukuna fights for the sake of the fight."
 },
 {
  "i": 105,
  "start": 283.56,
  "end": 284.8,
  "text": "Power isn't a tool to him."
 },
 {
  "i": 106,
  "start": 284.98,
  "end": 285.68,
  "text": "It's the point."
 },
 {
  "i": 107,
  "start": 286.48,
  "end": 288.44,
  "text": "In your version, that's the temptation."
 },
 {
  "i": 108,
  "start": 288.92,
  "end": 289.5,
  "text": "Not the strength."
 },
 {
  "i": 109,
  "start": 290.16,
  "end": 291.94,
  "text": "The relief of not needing anybody."
 },
 {
  "i": 110,
  "start": 292.82,
  "end": 293.88,
  "text": "You walk home in silence."
 },
 {
  "i": 111,
  "start": 294.7,
  "end": 298.56,
  "text": "Mara walks half a step behind you, the way people walk near a dog they aren't sure about."
 },
 {
  "i": 112,
  "start": 299.26,
  "end": 299.94,
  "text": "Three days left."
 },
 {
  "i": 113,
  "start": 301.6,
  "end": 305.52,
  "text": "A man shoves Mara at the bus stop, grabs her phone and laughs."
 },
 {
  "i": 114,
  "start": 306.9,
  "end": 308.62,
  "text": "\"Finish him,\" the voice says."
 },
 {
  "i": 115,
  "start": 309.12,
  "end": 309.44,
  "text": "Calm."
 },
 {
  "i": 116,
  "start": 310.12,
  "end": 310.48,
  "text": "Almost kind."
 },
 {
  "i": 117,
  "start": 311.9,
  "end": 313.82,
  "text": "Your hand is up before you decide."
 },
 {
  "i": 118,
  "start": 314.62,
  "end": 315.2,
  "text": "Two fingers."
 },
 {
  "i": 119,
  "start": 315.78,
  "end": 317.68,
  "text": "A clean line already in the air."
 },
 {
  "i": 120,
  "start": 318.68,
  "end": 319.4,
  "text": "You don't throw it."
 },
 {
  "i": 121,
  "start": 319.92,
  "end": 322.26,
  "text": "You throw yourself in front of the street lamp instead."
 },
 {
  "i": 122,
  "start": 322.9,
  "end": 323.7,
  "text": "The lamp falls."
 },
 {
  "i": 123,
  "start": 324.4,
  "end": 324.94,
  "text": "Everybody runs."
 },
 {
  "i": 124,
  "start": 325.6,
  "end": 327.76,
  "text": "The man drops her phone and keeps running."
 },
 {
  "i": 125,
  "start": 328.58,
  "end": 329.16,
  "text": "Nobody is hurt."
 },
 {
  "i": 126,
  "start": 330.4,
  "end": 331.12,
  "text": "Mara is shaking."
 },
 {
  "i": 127,
  "start": 332.08,
  "end": 332.88,
  "text": "\"I saw your face."
 },
 {
  "i": 128,
  "start": 333.44,
  "end": 334.8,
  "text": "For a second you looked happy.\""
 },
 {
  "i": 129,
  "start": 335.5,
  "end": 337.46,
  "text": "In your version, that's the real cost."
 },
 {
  "i": 130,
  "start": 338.12,
  "end": 338.62,
  "text": "Not the power."
 },
 {
  "i": 131,
  "start": 339.08,
  "end": 339.9,
  "text": "What it makes easy."
 },
 {
  "i": 132,
  "start": 340.62,
  "end": 342.38,
  "text": "That night she doesn't go to her sister's."
 },
 {
  "i": 133,
  "start": 342.92,
  "end": 346.12,
  "text": "She sits on the kitchen floor and says: \"Tell me what happens on Sunday.\""
 },
 {
  "i": 134,
  "start": 346.8,
  "end": 347.88,
  "text": "You almost don't tell her."
 },
 {
  "i": 135,
  "start": 348.34,
  "end": 349.74,
  "text": "The voice says there's no reason to."
 },
 {
  "i": 136,
  "start": 350.7,
  "end": 352.08,
  "text": "Then you look at the list on the fridge."
 },
 {
  "i": 137,
  "start": 352.82,
  "end": 353.7,
  "text": "Rule three is still there."
 },
 {
  "i": 138,
  "start": 354.18,
  "end": 357.28,
  "text": "You say: \"I'm smiling right now, aren't I?\""
 },
 {
  "i": 139,
  "start": 357.74,
  "end": 358.7,
  "text": "\"Yes,\" she says."
 },
 {
  "i": 140,
  "start": 360.08,
  "end": 360.74,
  "text": "\"Tell me anyway.\""
 },
 {
  "i": 141,
  "start": 361.34,
  "end": 361.86,
  "text": "Two days left."
 },
 {
  "i": 142,
  "start": 363.0,
  "end": 364.36,
  "text": "You tell her the truth."
 },
 {
  "i": 143,
  "start": 364.98,
  "end": 367.16,
  "text": "The Malevolent Shrine has no barrier."
 },
 {
  "i": 144,
  "start": 367.6,
  "end": 369.44,
  "text": "It doesn't close a wall around anyone."
 },
 {
  "i": 145,
  "start": 370.16,
  "end": 371.96,
  "text": "It cuts everything in range,"
 },
 {
  "i": 146,
  "start": 372.82,
  "end": 375.98,
  "text": "Cleave on anything with energy, Dismantle on everything else."
 },
 {
  "i": 147,
  "start": 376.88,
  "end": 381.75,
  "text": "The wiki says its reach can stretch to about two hundred meters, using a Binding Vow."
 },
 {
  "i": 148,
  "start": 381.7,
  "end": 386.08,
  "text": "In your version, it opens by itself at midnight on Sunday."
 },
 {
  "i": 149,
  "start": 386.8,
  "end": 387.76,
  "text": "You can't stop it."
 },
 {
  "i": 150,
  "start": 388.16,
  "end": 389.28,
  "text": "You can only choose where."
 },
 {
  "i": 151,
  "start": 390.14,
  "end": 392.24,
  "text": "You need three hundred meters of nothing."
 },
 {
  "i": 152,
  "start": 393.14,
  "end": 398.56,
  "text": "You find a quarry, four kilometers out of town, no houses, no road, one gate."
 },
 {
  "i": 153,
  "start": 399.52,
  "end": 400.26,
  "text": "Mara reads the map."
 },
 {
  "i": 154,
  "start": 400.88,
  "end": 401.92,
  "text": "\"You're going alone.\""
 },
 {
  "i": 155,
  "start": 402.58,
  "end": 403.32,
  "text": "\"That's the plan.\""
 },
 {
  "i": 156,
  "start": 404.04,
  "end": 405.14,
  "text": "\"That's a terrible plan.\""
 },
 {
  "i": 157,
  "start": 405.3,
  "end": 407.08,
  "text": "You think about calling someone."
 },
 {
  "i": 158,
  "start": 407.48,
  "end": 408.06,
  "text": "The police."
 },
 {
  "i": 159,
  "start": 408.58,
  "end": 409.06,
  "text": "A doctor."
 },
 {
  "i": 160,
  "start": 409.54,
  "end": 409.92,
  "text": "A priest."
 },
 {
  "i": 161,
  "start": 410.62,
  "end": 411.5,
  "text": "And saying what?"
 },
 {
  "i": 162,
  "start": 412.16,
  "end": 415.94,
  "text": "\"A fictional king lives in my body, and I need an empty field by midnight\"?"
 },
 {
  "i": 163,
  "start": 416.46,
  "end": 419.3,
  "text": "So you spend Saturday doing the only thing left."
 },
 {
  "i": 164,
  "start": 420.0,
  "end": 421.98,
  "text": "You drive out to the quarry and practice."
 },
 {
  "i": 165,
  "start": 422.76,
  "end": 424.62,
  "text": "You draw a circle in chalk on the gravel."
 },
 {
  "i": 166,
  "start": 425.12,
  "end": 426.74,
  "text": "Then a smaller one inside it."
 },
 {
  "i": 167,
  "start": 427.28,
  "end": 432.62,
  "text": "You stand at the center and try to feel the edge, the way you feel the edge of a step in the dark."
 },
 {
  "i": 168,
  "start": 433.2,
  "end": 437.66,
  "text": "Our guess is that learning where a power stops is harder than learning how hard it hits."
 },
 {
  "i": 169,
  "start": 438.24,
  "end": 439.24,
  "text": "Nobody teaches that part."
 },
 {
  "i": 170,
  "start": 439.78,
  "end": 442.6,
  "text": "By sunset you can hit the edge of the small circle,"
 },
 {
  "i": 171,
  "start": 443.56,
  "end": 444.34,
  "text": "twice out of five."
 },
 {
  "i": 172,
  "start": 445.2,
  "end": 445.84,
  "text": "Not three."
 },
 {
  "i": 173,
  "start": 446.64,
  "end": 447.2,
  "text": "Not four."
 },
 {
  "i": 174,
  "start": 448.04,
  "end": 449.14,
  "text": "Twice out of five isn't enough."
 },
 {
  "i": 175,
  "start": 449.74,
  "end": 450.48,
  "text": "It's what you have."
 },
 {
  "i": 176,
  "start": 451.1,
  "end": 451.68,
  "text": "One day left."
 },
 {
  "i": 177,
  "start": 451.68,
  "end": 453.92,
  "text": "Eleven forty p.m."
 },
 {
  "i": 178,
  "start": 454.76,
  "end": 456.4,
  "text": "Your arms are covered in marks."
 },
 {
  "i": 179,
  "start": 457.24,
  "end": 459.08,
  "text": "The voice has stopped suggesting."
 },
 {
  "i": 180,
  "start": 459.48,
  "end": 461.5,
  "text": "It just talks now, like it's always lived there."
 },
 {
  "i": 181,
  "start": 462.02,
  "end": 463.68,
  "text": "\"Let her stay,\" it says."
 },
 {
  "i": 182,
  "start": 463.68,
  "end": 465.74,
  "text": "\"Loss teaches better than anything.\""
 },
 {
  "i": 183,
  "start": 466.42,
  "end": 467.0,
  "text": "You turn around."
 },
 {
  "i": 184,
  "start": 467.96,
  "end": 468.8,
  "text": "Mara followed you."
 },
 {
  "i": 185,
  "start": 469.44,
  "end": 473.38,
  "text": "She's standing a hundred and fifty meters behind, at the gate, with a flashlight."
 },
 {
  "i": 186,
  "start": 474.28,
  "end": 474.9,
  "text": "Not far enough."
 },
 {
  "i": 187,
  "start": 475.72,
  "end": 480.54,
  "text": "In Shibuya, Sukuna narrowed his Shrine to about one hundred and forty meters to spare Megumi."
 },
 {
  "i": 188,
  "start": 481.44,
  "end": 483.1,
  "text": "In your version, you can do the same."
 },
 {
  "i": 189,
  "start": 483.78,
  "end": 485.14,
  "text": "But a vow isn't free."
 },
 {
  "i": 190,
  "start": 485.8,
  "end": 487.7,
  "text": "You give up the thing you're narrowing for."
 },
 {
  "i": 191,
  "start": 488.16,
  "end": 491.28,
  "text": "You say it out loud: the radius, the number and the price."
 },
 {
  "i": 192,
  "start": 492.0,
  "end": 492.98,
  "text": "You aren't paying with power."
 },
 {
  "i": 193,
  "start": 493.54,
  "end": 494.4,
  "text": "You're paying with the King."
 },
 {
  "i": 194,
  "start": 495.2,
  "end": 495.78,
  "text": "All of him."
 },
 {
  "i": 195,
  "start": 496.28,
  "end": 498.86,
  "text": "All the marks, all the voice, all the ease."
 },
 {
  "i": 196,
  "start": 499.46,
  "end": 499.76,
  "text": "Midnight."
 },
 {
  "i": 197,
  "start": 500.64,
  "end": 501.86,
  "text": "It opens without a sound."
 },
 {
  "i": 198,
  "start": 502.58,
  "end": 503.08,
  "text": "Not a wall."
 },
 {
  "i": 199,
  "start": 503.42,
  "end": 503.92,
  "text": "Not a dome."
 },
 {
  "i": 200,
  "start": 504.42,
  "end": 506.12,
  "text": "Just everything in range, cut."
 },
 {
  "i": 201,
  "start": 506.66,
  "end": 509.8,
  "text": "The quarry wall, the crane, the old sign, the gravel."
 },
 {
  "i": 202,
  "start": 510.62,
  "end": 513.26,
  "text": "Thousands of clean lines, then nothing."
 },
 {
  "i": 203,
  "start": 513.26,
  "end": 514.8,
  "text": "Hundred and forty meters."
 },
 {
  "i": 204,
  "start": 515.72,
  "end": 517.44,
  "text": "Not a hundred and fifty."
 },
 {
  "i": 205,
  "start": 517.44,
  "end": 518.98,
  "text": "Mara is ten meters outside it."
 },
 {
  "i": 206,
  "start": 519.5,
  "end": 520.66,
  "text": "Her flashlight is still on."
 },
 {
  "i": 207,
  "start": 521.46,
  "end": 525.36,
  "text": "The voice says one last thing, very small: \"Interesting.\""
 },
 {
  "i": 208,
  "start": 526.1,
  "end": 526.64,
  "text": "Then it's gone."
 },
 {
  "i": 209,
  "start": 527.76,
  "end": 528.6,
  "text": "Seven days."
 },
 {
  "i": 210,
  "start": 529.54,
  "end": 533.56,
  "text": "Nobody in range survived, because there was no one in range."
 },
 {
  "i": 211,
  "start": 534.0,
  "end": 535.18,
  "text": "That was the whole plan."
 },
 {
  "i": 212,
  "start": 536.0,
  "end": 537.06,
  "text": "You wake up as yourself."
 },
 {
  "i": 213,
  "start": 537.84,
  "end": 545.46,
  "text": "You're lying on the quarry floor at dawn, and Mara is sitting next to you, holding her flashlight, which is finally out of battery."
 },
 {
  "i": 214,
  "start": 546.0,
  "end": 548.72,
  "text": "\"You smiled for a second, at the end,\" she says."
 },
 {
  "i": 215,
  "start": 549.3,
  "end": 549.82,
  "text": "\"I know.\""
 },
 {
  "i": 216,
  "start": 550.68,
  "end": 551.62,
  "text": "\"You can stop now.\""
 },
 {
  "i": 217,
  "start": 552.3,
  "end": 554.76,
  "text": "You laugh, and it's your laugh again."
 },
 {
  "i": 218,
  "start": 555.66,
  "end": 557.56,
  "text": "At home, the marks are gone."
 },
 {
  "i": 219,
  "start": 558.22,
  "end": 559.44,
  "text": "The marks are gone."
 },
 {
  "i": 220,
  "start": 560.28,
  "end": 564.62,
  "text": "The bread on the counter is a normal loaf, and Mara has already burned a piece of it."
 },
 {
  "i": 221,
  "start": 565.16,
  "end": 567.18,
  "text": "The wall still has its clean line."
 },
 {
  "i": 222,
  "start": 567.92,
  "end": 569.38,
  "text": "The landlord still hasn't noticed."
 },
 {
  "i": 223,
  "start": 570.18,
  "end": 572.82,
  "text": "In your version, that's what the title meant."
 },
 {
  "i": 224,
  "start": 573.58,
  "end": 575.8,
  "text": "Nobody survives seven days as the King."
 },
 {
  "i": 225,
  "start": 576.76,
  "end": 577.38,
  "text": "Not even the King."
 },
 {
  "i": 226,
  "start": 578.34,
  "end": 579.4,
  "text": "Would you have narrowed it?"
 },
 {
  "i": 227,
  "start": 580.08,
  "end": 580.8,
  "text": "Tell me in the comments."
 },
 {
  "i": 228,
  "start": 581.42,
  "end": 584.06,
  "text": "And if you want the next one, tell me who you want to become."
 }
]